--- !u!114 &1431064135
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1431064134}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2a399ced64b134d65a0ff1f3a79ec2ce, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Mission
  goal: 3
  help: 'FINDERS KEEPERS. Take the Garuda with your marines. If it blows up, you
    lose.

    1. Press P. POWER (key 3): click SEN, WEP and AUX to DRAW.

    2.
    ORDERS: click the alert once, from C3 to C2.

    3. Scan it and fire the railgun,
    as in WEAPONS FREE. Stop once one side is open.

    4. HANGAR (key 4): pick
    the interceptors and set DISABLE. Open the doors, throw the six stage switches,
    pull the launch lever. They stop it.

    5. Do the same with the assault boats
    on SECURE. The marines take it.'
